{"title":"2005 CEMC Hypatia Problems/Problem 1c","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1\"><a href=\"#Problem_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Verifying_Solutions\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Verifying Solutions</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_1\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_CEMC_Hypatia_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2005 CEMC Hypatia Problems/Problem 1\">Problem 1</a></span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_CEMC_Hypatia_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=T-1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>For numbers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" />, the notation <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/d/4/9d4321dbea9f298dfe9c114d4c440694632bed8a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a \\diamond b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"36\" height=\"14\" /> means <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/3/8c30d05e56161d6ef29d2514560e67f60d593dac.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a^{2} - 4b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"58\" height=\"18\" />. For example, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/7/3/a7301c9a7acd5239967ae52397b000ddc70c1760.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5 \\diamond 3 = 5^{2} - 4(3) = 13$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"175\" height=\"21\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_CEMC_Hypatia_Problems/Problem_1c&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The numbers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/092e364e1d9d19ad5fffb0b46ef4cc7f2da02c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> are such that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/e/e0e352855196c0c08111bf71cf07fe68b6329468.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3 \\diamond x = y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"72\" height=\"17\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/f/a/9fa15d343f4b8ca9a072ae4d1e35cf15d0425ded.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2 \\diamond y = 8x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"81\" height=\"17\" />.\n</p><p>Determine the values of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/092e364e1d9d19ad5fffb0b46ef4cc7f2da02c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_CEMC_Hypatia_Problems/Problem_1c&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Because <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/f/5/6f52dc89591f005f9be65b13c0463c19a1f3fa96.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a \\diamond b = a^{2} - 4b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"117\" height=\"18\" />, we have:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/1/1/5117426ee65776ae80a27ddd32d7f2dc4adda0ae.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3 \\diamond x = 3^{2} - 4x = y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"155\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/8/81885ee01acd8720a0cd017c878bdc8a6a369bf6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$9 - 4x = y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"86\" height=\"17\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/1/8/3181e562c7b86eabfb96ef1834cfdaa0f6b00f9b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2 \\diamond y = 2^{2} - 4y = 8x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"163\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/3/5/a352cae44ffca708c0e1cb5d13f6133bba3cb7b4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4 - 4y = 8x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"96\" height=\"17\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/d/5/ed5e12ac255cbf4f58c2127f912d76daab842c1b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4(1 - y) = 8x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"110\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/d/8/6d879fa542875163c41e91732544e6d7e0ab1a53.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1 - y = \\frac{8x}{4} = 2x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"134\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/7/f/77fb067bf68edf3438cffbde59e34538754c31e9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-y = 2x - 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"101\" height=\"17\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/9/2/192396db797ec159747a7679e319703d230dc16a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y = 1 - 2x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"86\" height=\"17\" />\n</p><p>Plugging in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/e/e/1eee8b69165cc62f3dd95c24069c3afbe65e1f41.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$9 - 4x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"53\" height=\"15\" /> into <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/092e364e1d9d19ad5fffb0b46ef4cc7f2da02c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" />, we have:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/f/a/cfa8e2fa34cc6299ae37d55a1de1c235288dd48f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$9 - 4x = 1 - 2x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"128\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/1/e/51ef65181dc2d6a13faa875024a1e695ca085476.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-2x + 4x = 9 - 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"142\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/f/5/7f5aa13454f4c40f3d733157bcbf3ddffab3c91b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2x = 8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"55\" height=\"14\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/7/4/374b3fab40c8fe9e71c6f776869988e632a48482.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = \\frac{8}{2} = \\boxed{4}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"94\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p>Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/9/2/192396db797ec159747a7679e319703d230dc16a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y = 1 - 2x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"86\" height=\"17\" />, we can plug in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/a/7/ea768618848c1aea8a32490c327911e8ab7243a3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = 4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"46\" height=\"14\" /> now to find <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/092e364e1d9d19ad5fffb0b46ef4cc7f2da02c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" />:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/9/a/19ab4df575359a592947bae75ca1c7033d56ab77.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y = 1 - 2 \\times 4 = 1 - 8 = \\boxed{-7}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -8px\" width=\"231\" height=\"26\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Verifying_Solutions\">Verifying Solutions</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_CEMC_Hypatia_Problems/Problem_1c&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Verifying Solutions\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>In the solution, we got <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/a/7/ea768618848c1aea8a32490c327911e8ab7243a3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = 4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"46\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/9/9/b9913470d96a15fdeb17a5a4145fcc5f7471dd66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y = -7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"59\" height=\"17\" /> as our solution for the equations.\n</p><p>First, we can plug-in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/a/7/ea768618848c1aea8a32490c327911e8ab7243a3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = 4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"46\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/9/9/b9913470d96a15fdeb17a5a4145fcc5f7471dd66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y = -7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"59\" height=\"17\" /> into <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/e/e0e352855196c0c08111bf71cf07fe68b6329468.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3 \\diamond x = y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"72\" height=\"17\" /> to make sure that the statement is true. We have:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/7/e07dea9f7f1d1279f529c99e5632c62052354377.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3 \\diamond 4 = -7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"85\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/9/3/693beb1ce828665673fdb27dcec3af90d921ba0f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3^{2} - 4 \\times 4 = -7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"128\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/3/2/732c299b5c4805668b2e7dc880ae1e050464fd2d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$9 - 16 = -7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"99\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/2/d/72d53f492c156b566a60896390c738c60e901a7e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-7 = -7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"73\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p>This statement is true, so our solution looks correct so far. Next, we can plug-in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/a/7/ea768618848c1aea8a32490c327911e8ab7243a3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = 4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"46\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/9/9/b9913470d96a15fdeb17a5a4145fcc5f7471dd66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y = -7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"59\" height=\"17\" /> into <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/f/a/9fa15d343f4b8ca9a072ae4d1e35cf15d0425ded.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2 \\diamond y = 8x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"81\" height=\"17\" />.\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/2/7/f27d562b372e1994c5dea785b4ff8a447c1ff97f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2 \\diamond -7 = 8 \\times 4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"116\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/6/3/a6368e6296b7000c95582e86e1118f2eb4bebb6f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2^{2} - 4 \\times -7 = 32$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"138\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/5/b/75bb843a1c35f8ad144b1f8e9f9c5254aca5c033.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4 + 28 = 32$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"94\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/a/a/8aaa6b5022ae365c788beee856110fc39f187b34.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$32 = 32$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"62\" height=\"14\" />\n</p><p>Both statements are true, so our solution has been verified.\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017205450\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.021 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.035 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 201/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 300/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 8410/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    7.413      1 2005_CEMC_Hypatia_Problems/Problem_1\n100.00%    7.413      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:35650:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017205450 and revision id 278107. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}